sieve-filter-v2
; melody-ending-v2 for the notes3 family: the last note is the tonic, held at least so long (a
; length code, as that many sixteenths of TPQ ticks: a q is TPQ ticks).
id        melody-ending-notes3
version   1
author    Edward James Gordon (written with Claude)
origin    ai-directed
lines     audio
symbols   notes3*
describe  The last note is the tonic, held at least so long.
param     tonic  choice  C C,C#,D,D#,E,F,F#,G,G#,A,A#,B the note to end on
param     hold   choice  e s,e,E,q,Q,h,H,w the shortest the last note may be

states    2
start     0
accept    1
for s 0 1
  for n 1 {LONGEST}
    t {s} @{REST(n)} 0
    for p 1 {PITCHES}
      for k 1 {LEVELS}
        if {(LOW + p - 1) % 12 == tonic && n * 4 >= SIXTEENTHS(hold) * TPQ}
          t {s} @{NOTE(p, k, n)} 1
        else
          t {s} @{NOTE(p, k, n)} 0
        fi
      done
    done
  done
done
end
